---
source: crates/tds_cli/tests/ui.rs
description: "fn copy_into(dest: mut List[Int], src: List[Int]):\n    for x in src:\n        dest.push(x)\n\nfn main():\n    var xs = [1, 2]\n    copy_into(mut xs, xs)\n"
---
error[TDS0410]: `xs` is lent with `mut` and also used by another argument
  ┌─ TDS0410-conflicting-borrow.tds:7:23
  │
7 │     copy_into(mut xs, xs)
  │               ------  ^^ also used here
  │               │        
  │               lent with `mut` here
  │
  = note: while a value is lent with `mut`, nothing else may use it
  = help: copy what you need first: `let copy = xs`
